{"unit_id":"Destinhue__dsh-video-vision#card-zh","repo":"Destinhue/dsh-video-vision","commit":"2c7cb2d502b0e04abdff5f138e11e04a31bd2454","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-video-vision 是面向 DSH 的视频理解插件，通过注册五个工具，把本地视频、直链或 B 站视频转成可供模型查看和检索的画面与文本。它能先读取媒体元数据和阅读计划，再生成带时间码的分镜图、对指定片段放大、输出整片文字地图，或将讲课、幻灯片和录屏整理成带时间戳的文本。分镜会关联画面、切点、字幕和音频信息，文本阅读可利用 OCR 和已有字幕。适合分析视频内容、查找片段和整理课程材料；需要 ffmpeg，OCR 与语音识别引擎按需配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:52-67","src/index.js:120-152","src/tools.js:12-21","src/read.js:1-23"]}
{"unit_id":"Destinhue__dsh-video-vision#card-en","repo":"Destinhue/dsh-video-vision","commit":"2c7cb2d502b0e04abdff5f138e11e04a31bd2454","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-video-vision adds five video tools to DSH: metadata, timestamped storyboards, interval zoom, text maps, and timestamped lecture or screen recording text. It uses subtitles and OCR to help review footage and organize course material. ffmpeg is required; OCR and speech engines are optional.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:52-67","src/index.js:120-152","src/tools.js:12-21","src/read.js:1-23"]}
