{"unit_id":"Destinhue__dsh-video-vision#feature-1","repo":"Destinhue/dsh-video-vision","commit":"2c7cb2d502b0e04abdff5f138e11e04a31bd2454","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-video-vision 的功能「视频分镜」：为视频或选定时间窗生成一张分镜图，并附带逐格时间码和文本索引。调用 video_storyboard，可调整细节级别、格数和时间范围。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:102-126","src/tools.js:93-130"]}
{"unit_id":"Destinhue__dsh-video-vision#feature-2","repo":"Destinhue/dsh-video-vision","commit":"2c7cb2d502b0e04abdff5f138e11e04a31bd2454","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-video-vision 的功能「视频放大」：针对一个短时间窗提取更清晰的画面格，便于检查字幕、动作或画面细节。调用 video_zoom 并提供视频和起止时间。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:102-118"]}
{"unit_id":"Destinhue__dsh-video-vision#feature-3","repo":"Destinhue/dsh-video-vision","commit":"2c7cb2d502b0e04abdff5f138e11e04a31bd2454","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-video-vision 的功能「视频文字阅读」：将讲课、幻灯片或录屏整理为带时间戳的文本，可结合视频字幕和 OCR 识别画面文字。调用 video_read 并传入视频文件。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:120-152","src/read.js:1-23"]}
{"unit_id":"Destinhue__dsh-video-vision#feature-4","repo":"Destinhue/dsh-video-vision","commit":"2c7cb2d502b0e04abdff5f138e11e04a31bd2454","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-video-vision 的功能「整片文字地图」：把视频分成时间窗口并输出文本概览，帮助决定值得进一步查看的片段，不返回分镜图片。调用 video_outline 并指定视频。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:102-118","src/tools.js:12-16"]}
